        "type": "X_PRESET",
        "version": "1.4",
        "description": "Unity Humanoid / VRM 0.x mapping, both the suffix style (UpperArm_L) and Unity's own prefix style (LeftUpperArm). Separator/case variants are handled by fuzzy matching. Thumbs follow Unity / VRM 0.x semantics (Proximal is the joint at the wrist) -- VRM 1.0 renamed that joint to ThumbMetacarpal and reused 'ThumbProximal' for the second one, so VRM 1.0 assets belong in vrm.json, not here.",
